    "title": "40 word featured snippet",
    "description": "🚀 Stick to a 40-word limit per answer where possible to help trigger snippets. Example: Question: “What are antioxidants?” Answer: “Antioxidants are compounds that prevent cell damage by neutralizing free radicals, supporting overall health.” ✅ Explanation: Short, direct answers increase the likelihood of appearing as featured snippets , especially for definitions or quick responses, enhancing visibility on search engines. 📈"
